{"study_accession":"PRJNA892449","secondary_study_accession":"SRP403618","title":"Therapeutic adenine base editing of human hematopoietic stem cells","description":"In this paper, we confirmed for the first time that ABE8e-sgRNA RNP complex can achieve efficient multiplex editing in both healthy and beta-thalassemia human HSPCs. After strict detection by deep sequencing, no harmful off-target editing was found. Comparing mRNA and RNP delivery methods, we found that RNP delivery significantly reduced gRNA-dependent DNA off-targeting without compromising editing efficiency. Notably, we successfully repaired two causative mutations in situ using ABE8e-SpRY, providing support for the use of ABE to treat other genetic diseases. Stored here are deep sequencing files for editing efficiency tests at both on-target and off-target sites after editing.","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":9,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN31382585","study_accession":"PRJNA892449","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"Human sample from Homo sapiens","description":"Human sample from Homo sapiens","sex":"not collected","geo_sample":"","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2022-10-21","attributes":[["isolate","anonymous healthy donor"],["age","not collected"],["biomaterial_provider","HUANG HE@FAHZU"],["sex","not collected"],["tissue","blood"],["genome editor","ABE8e(mRNA form)"],["sgRNA","sg1620"],["bio-repeat","rep1"],["on or off target","not applicable"],["engraft","no"],["co-editing","no"],["for seq type","RNA seq"],["edit reagent conc.","15each"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR21980831","experiment_accession":"SRX17963991","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"PolyA","instrument_model":"HiSeq X Ten","read_count":24093935,"base_count":6707715894,"first_public":"2022-10-21","experiment_title":"HiSeq X Ten sequencing: RNA-seq of human gene editing cells : HSPCs"}],"labels":[]},{"sample_accession":"SAMN31382586","study_accession":"PRJNA892449","